            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor questioned whether an alien who has no protected ground to stay has any legal right to remain, emphasizing that expedited proceedings are permissible."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
