            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked whether the respondent\u2019s view applies only to factual matters or also to legal and mixed questions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c6b9ff3eec57b16f8bdf81f7023b292fda599ae83bce0e4745432cdda1ad89a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4c6b9ff3eec5-0001-0003"
