              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito referenced earlier \u201cfinality era\u201d cases, noting that individuals once found improperly detained had a right to remain in the United States."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c6b9ff3eec57b16f8bdf81f7023b292fda599ae83bce0e4745432cdda1ad89a",
