        ],
        "text": "The Department of Homeland Security argues that Congress created an expedited removal system for aliens who arrive without entry documents and are therefore inadmissible."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Respondent",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c6b9ff3eec57b16f8bdf81f7023b292fda599ae83bce0e4745432cdda1ad89a",
